title: Shuffle Leadership
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: shuffle_leadership_timer = 0 and difficulty >= 0
on-arrival: month_activities += 1; shuffle_leadership_timer = 8;
card-image: img/kcp_shuffle_leadership.png
go-to: rm_main

Changing the leadership of the party is painful, but perhaps it is necessary to adapt to changing circumstances.

Removing advisors will increase dissent from their faction of the party, while selecting advisors will increase a faction's strength.

- @rm_main: Remove advisors
- @add_advisors: Add advisors
- @remove_none: Don't change advisors.
- @easy_discard


###################### removing leaders

@rm_main
title: Remove advisors.
tags: socialist_advisor, humanist_advisor, liberal_advisor, constitutionalist_advisor, neoforsvollrist_advisor, nonfactional_advisor 
frequency: 1

- #remove_advisor
- @add_advisors: Add advisors

@remove_none
title: Stop changing advisors.
go-to: root
tags: remove_advisor

@remove_annastasia
title: Remove Annastasia
view-if: annastasia_advisor = 1
tags: remove_advisor
on-arrival: annastasia_advisor = 0; constitutionalist_dissent += 5; n_advisors -= 1
go-to: rm_main

Annastasia has been removed as a advisor. The constitutionalists disapprove.

@remove_iketh
title: Remove Iketh
view-if: iketh_advisor = 1
tags: remove_advisor
on-arrival: iketh_advisor = 0; humanist_dissent += 5; n_advisors -= 1
go-to: rm_main

Iketh has been removed as a advisor. The humanists disapprove.

####################### adding advisors

@add_advisors
title: Add advisors
choose-if: n_advisors < 3
unavailable-subtitle: Maximum of 3 advisors.
go-to: advisor_menu

@advisor_menu
title: Add other advisors.
tags: socialist_advisor, humanist_advisor, liberal_advisor, constitutionalist_advisor, neoforsvollrist_advisor, nonfactional_advisor
frequency: 1


- @socialist: Add Socialists
- @humanist: Add Humanists
- @liberal: Add Liberals
- @constitutionalist: Add Constitutionalists
- @neoforsvollrist: Add NeoForsvollrists
- @nonfactional: Add non-factional advisors
- @rm_main: Remove advisors instead.
- @remove_none: Stop changing advisors.

@socialist
view-if: n_advisors < 3

- #socialist_advisor

@humanist
view-if: n_advisors < 3

- #humanist_advisor

@liberal
view-if: n_advisors < 3

- #liberal_advisor

@constitutionalist
view-if: n_advisors < 3

- #constitutionalist_advisor

@neoforsvollrist
view-if: n_advisors < 3

- #neoforsvollrist_advisor

@nonfactional
view-if: n_advisors < 3

- #nonfactional_advisor

@add_annastasia
title: Annastasia von Yoaken
subtitle: Annastasia is one of the founders of our party and is widely respected for her work on writing the constitution however some of her critics accuse her of building a cult of personality and a machiavellian like persona.
is-card: true
card-image: img/portraits/Annastasia_Youken_poster.png
tags: constitutionalist_advisor
view-if: annastasia_advisor = 0 and n_advisors < 3 
on-arrival: annastasia_advisor = 1; n_advisors += 1
go-to: advisor_menu

Annastasia Yoaken is now our advisor.

@add_annastasia
title: Iketh Forsvollr
subtitle: Iketh Forsvollr is a humanist liberal-leaning politician who has been in almost every goverment since the Kaddian Empire. He is mostly intrested in liberal economic policies and humanist policies. He is wary of radicalism.
is-card: true
card-image: img/portraits/iketh_portrait.jpg
tags: humanist_advisor
view-if: iketh_advisor = 0 and n_advisors < 3 
on-arrival: iketh_advisor = 1; n_advisors += 1
go-to: advisor_menu

Iketh is now our advisor.


